{"code":0,"message":"ok","data":{"post":{"id":"p_seed_030","createdAt":"2026-09-14T06:55:36.677Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-17T00:48:36.785Z","author":{"uid":"u_life","name":"城市生活志","handle":"city_life","verified":true,"bio":"记录城市里的烟火气与人情味","color":"#0b4f9e"},"content":"三条新线同日开通，城市群通勤半径大幅缩短。有朋友算了算，上班单程少四十分钟——这四十分钟，一年就是三百多个小时，是能陪家人吃早饭的时间。","images":["./img/news/44-china-cover.jpg"],"quote":{"id":"n_0013o3q","title":"全国高铁网再扩容：三条新线同日开通，城市群通勤半径大幅缩短","summary":"今天上午，随着三趟首发列车分别从三座枢纽站驶出，我国高速铁路网再添三条新线路，新增运营里程约 820 公里，沿线 26 座车站同步投入使用。","cover":"./img/news/45-china-cover.jpg","channel":"china","channelName":"国内","source":"寰宇新闻网"},"topics":[],"repostOf":"","pinned":false,"status":"published","stats":{"likes":721,"reposts":2,"replies":2,"views":41389,"bookmarks":40}},"replies":[{"id":"c_seed_p_seed_030_0","createdAt":"2026-09-14T07:06:36.677Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-14T09:01:36.680Z","articleId":"p_seed_030","uid":"u_data","user":"数据小站","handle":"data_station","content":"通勤时间是幸福感里最被低估的变量。","likes":138,"status":"published"},{"id":"c_seed_p_seed_030_1","createdAt":"2026-09-14T07:17:36.677Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-14T09:01:36.680Z","articleId":"p_seed_030","uid":"u_flash","user":"寰宇快讯","handle":"huanyu_flash","content":"这个角度值得做一期报道。","likes":116,"status":"published"}],"interactions":{}}}